  ],
  "hints": [
    "A single stack gives you the wrong order, so use two: an inbox and an outbox.",
    "Push always goes onto the inbox. Pop and peek always come off the outbox.",
    "When the outbox is empty, tip the entire inbox into it, which reverses the order exactly once. Never tip while the outbox still has items, or you will interleave the order. Each element moves at most twice, which is what makes it amortised O(1)."
  ],
